2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火の魔法・水の魔法・雷の魔法\n・風の魔法・この中で１つだけ\n手に入れられます。\n貴方はどの属性を選びますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風の魔法で！\nそよ風すきなので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近思ったんだけど、\nメンバーの事、呼び捨てなんだね。\nニックネームとか使わないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかわからんけど、\n私は呼び捨てが多いかも。\n私以外でもけっこうみんな\n呼び捨てしてるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はみんな朝から撮影ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして名古屋ー\nそして大阪ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/20/5245918/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がががががんばりまりか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-25317":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1R8010A229T34W9VBDG69","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1R91K4QT01AEXR15JQYEN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 昨日はポートメッセ名古屋で6枚目シングルの個別握手会がありました( ・∇・)⭐️\n \n お越し下さった皆さん、ありがとうございました！\n \n 皆さんとお話できてとても楽しかったです🙂\n 最近はダンス練習の日々だったので、皆さんと会えたから今日もまた頑張れそうです！！\n \n 会いに来てくれた皆さんもお仕事とか勉強とかすごく頑張ってて、私も頑張ろうって凄い元気をいただけました！\n 私ばかり元気をもらってるんじゃないかなって心配になるけど、私は皆さんに元気とか幸せとか届けることが出来てますかね？？\n \n 私の存在で、お仕事とか学校頑張ろうって思ってもらえてたら嬉しいなぁ（´-`）.｡oO\n \n 昨日の加藤！！\n \n 2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RA3FAB0XNREKTDMYAKNB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n お気に入りのトップス(^｡^)\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RBDXTYYC9J23VZGM4Q2N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 全身の写真まともなのがこの写真しかありませんでした🦈\n \n 4部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RCG0C12BGXTSJRPCW32Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n くるりんぱハーフツイン！\n 初期、ライブでよくやっていた髪型！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RDKXFQNTC05AHSW4W4CS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 何をしてる時だろう、、これ、、\n \n 5部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1REMKXB62TJTTXCYX90DT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ポニーテール！低め！\n \n ポニーテールはやっぱり楽ちんで最高ですね〜(^｡^)\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1RFRDPCY3EPKFCHMM8N4D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 1部の写真撮り忘れちゃいましたごめんなさい！！\n \n \n 改めて会いに来てくださった皆さん、本当にありがとうございました！\n また会いに来てくれたら嬉しいです( ・∇・)💕\n \n また更新します！\n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-101999":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。\n乃木坂46の矢久保美緒です。\nみっちゃんってよんでくださ〜い👼🏻❤︎❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#はやしぶろぐ でいつかの #miogram の答えあわせをしてくれたのでわたしも載せる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZE61F4RQJ17EGGC0RGKHRG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目が変わっていたの知らなかったから待ち合わせした時別の人だと思った🥺"},{"type":"break"},